# 🤖 AI Agent System (JARVIS-style)

An open-source autonomous AI agent system designed for multi-model orchestration, task execution, and real-world automation.

## 🧠 Vision

This project aims to build a production-ready AI system similar to JARVIS / F.R.I.D.A.Y — combining multiple AI models, tools, and interfaces into a single intelligent system.

## ⚡ Features

- Multi-model AI support (OpenAI, Claude, local models)
- Autonomous task execution
- Voice + chat interaction
- Modular agent architecture
- API-first design (FastAPI / Go hybrid ready)
- Docker-based deployment

## 🏗️ Architecture

- Agent Core (decision making)
- Tool system (API, scripts, automation)
- Multi-model router
- Memory system (planned)
- UI (chat + voice)

## 🔥 Why this matters

Most AI tools are isolated. This project focuses on:

- Connecting multiple models into one system
- Enabling real-world task execution
- Building scalable AI infrastructure

## 🛠️ Use Cases

- Personal AI assistant
- Developer automation agent
- Multi-model AI research
- Business automation system

